DISCLAIMER
----------
This is security research on hardware owned by the author, for the purpose of
restoring control over a personally-owned, bootloader-locked device.

The exploit chain triggers a kernel panic and reboots the device. Repeated
triggering may cause storage corruption. Run it only on hardware you own and
only where you have explicit authorization.
